    "title": "Which fast food restaurants are open on Easter?",
    "text": "DININGWhich chain, fast food restaurants are open on Easter? Kaycee SloanCincinnati EnquirerApril 2, 2026Updated April 5, 2026, 12:05 a.m. ETHip, hop, hurray! Easter, a Christian holiday commemorating the resurrection of Jesus Christ, lands this Sunday, marking the end of the 40-day lenten season, a time of prayer, fasting and giving.Restaurants that are typically closed Sundays, such as Chick-fil-A, are also closed on Easter. But for those looking to celebrate the end of Lent with fast food, there are plenty of other quick-service and dine-in restaurants that stay open.",
